[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Elephant Gambit"]
[Variation "Knight to g5"]
[ECO "C40"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "trap,hanging-piece"]
[Refutes "1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d5 3. exd5 e4 4. Ng5"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d5 3. exd5 e4 4. Ng5? { Dodges the pawn, but the knight lands on a square the black queen already covers along the diagonal from d8. [%cal Gd8g5] } 4... Qxg5 { Takes the knight for nothing. } 5. Nc3 5... Qe5 { Escapes the attack and keeps the queen centralised, while Black is a whole piece up. } 6. Qe2 6... Nf6 *
